      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashland%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from Henry Clay’s Ashland estate in Lexington, Kentucky, honoring the famed statesman.",
